":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-09T03:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:51:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-13T16:51:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nMaster (custom build)\n4.8 dev 7\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 \n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen exporting a simple test app using a debug web build you can't interact with control nodes. For example, in the screenshot below you can see what it looks like when I tried to drag the slider. Instead of dragging the slider itself a selection box appeared around the entire node and the whole thing was moved around. Please note, this is running in a web browser using an export template.\n\n<img width=\"2554\" height=\"1285\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9034db20-ae15-4cd0-b56a-e41e128c33ab\" />\n\nI'm not convinced that manipulating nodes using editor tools makes sense in the running game. But even so, that should be restricted to in-editor builds inside the embedded game view. Export builds should always behave the same regardless of whether they are launched from the editor or launched from an external platform. \n\nI haven't checked, but the fact that the selection rect appeared in an export build means that we are now shipping part of the editor in export builds, which obviously is a huge problem for web builds where space is at a premium. But this is also an issue for other platforms since users often ship with debug templates. Again, I haven't measured, but we should not be adding editor bloat to export templates. Editor bloat should be restricted to editor builds. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Have a 2D game with control nodes that you want to interact with\n2. Run the game using the one click deploy running with the \"run in browser\" option\n3. Try interacting with the game\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119317","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124312/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}